    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEMO version released for Your FEEDBACK to make the game BETTER.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Very STRANGE and UNIQUE Indie Rage PSX Styled Retro\u00a0Horror Game...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You came to Nolemland for adventure, but now you're Chuck\u2019s slave, trapped in a nightmare. His son\u2019s hunger never ends, and neither does your job - unless you find the one way to break the cycle and destroy Chuck\u2019s world.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This is CHUCK:</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565820/extras/8fb2c4570cb1723c029cb332d8e27dfb.poster.avif?t=1746023946\" width=564 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565820/extras/8fb2c4570cb1723c029cb332d8e27dfb.webm?t=1746023946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565820/extras/8fb2c4570cb1723c029cb332d8e27dfb.mp4?t=1746023946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This is his STARVING SON:</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565820/extras/83784a54f46fc98247763ac895b2e2fa.poster.avif?t=1746023946\" width=566 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565820/extras/83784a54f46fc98247763ac895b2e2fa.webm?t=1746023946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/